  "details": "I really really wan't to make awesome and inovative levels, but the sdk is so limited that only around a hand full of scripts are supported. For example i wanted to put in an audio visualizer in my club and after searching for 8 straight hours i found a free one. Everything worked fine in the play-mode of unity. But after i uploaded it VRchat said: NOPE.\nWhy are we so limited when it comes to this? You can't even think about what people could archive if we had more freedom.",
